{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0",
  "contractVersion": "1.0.0",
  "description": "Canonical ownership map for the Silver projection plane (WP2.4). One entry per projector in services/silver/dispatcher.py::_ALL_PROJECTORS, in EXACT dispatcher order (ADR-C3 deterministic semantic order). eventTypes are the projector's dispatcher handles; eventFamilies are the event-registry families those types belong to; unregisteredEventTypes are handled types absent from event-registry.json (declared honestly, not hidden). Canonical-activity ownership (ADR-C4: one real-world event, one activity) is per event type: the CommsProjector owns activity for all communication events, the TouchpointProjector owns its non-comms types, and otherwise the first adapter-backed projector in dispatcher order owns the type while later adapter-backed emitters converge via the idempotent canonical_activity upsert (convergentActivityEventTypes). activityRole=no_activity marks projectors whose table has no canonical-activity adapter. Families with no dispatcher projector are declared under noProjection with an honest status. Enforced against the live dispatcher by scripts/validate_projector_ownership.py; generated artifacts: Backend Architecture/aether-backend/services/silver/generated_ownership.py, docs/_generated/projector-ownership-table.md (via scripts/generate_platform_contracts.py).",
  "activityRoles": [
    "comms_owner",
    "touchpoint_owner",
    "fact_emitter",
    "no_activity"
  ],
  "noProjectionStatuses": [
    "no_projection",
    "pending",
    "pending_pr2"
  ],
